"prompt": "<p>Applications can be classified as industrial, scientific, commercial, process control, and automation information processing systems.</p><ol type=\"a\"><li>For each application listed below, identify the class of information processing systems.<ol type=\"i\"><li>Banking industry — managing user accounts</li><li>Weather forecasting — predicting the weather</li><li>Household appliance — sequencing wash cycle tasks in a washing machine</li><li>Manufacturing industry — using robots to assemble car components</li></ol><i>(4 marks)</i></li><li>For the past 30 years, the XY Company has been processing data using a computer system.<ol type=\"i\"><li>In the earlier days, data were collected and stored on a data tape that only allowed the data to be stored one after the other. During processing, the data were accessed in the order in which they were entered. State the method of file organization implemented and the type of access used during processing. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>In later years, data were stored by a device that allowed the data to be stored anywhere on the media. However, the data were still stored in the same way, that is, one after the other. A file structure was created that allowed the data to be accessed in any order. State the method of file organization implemented and the type of access used during processing. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Currently, the data are stored in files in which the records are ordered according to a key value. State the type of data access used during processing. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>New devices are now installed that allow specific data to be captured directly from the input document. State the name for this type of input document. <i>(1 mark)</i></li></ol></li></ol><p style=\"text-align:right\"><b>Total 10 marks</b></p>",
