"stimulus": "<p>Paragraph for (d) and (e):</p><blockquote class=\"passage\"><p>A printer is an output device on a computer system used to print hard copy output. Printers fall into two categories: impact and non-impact.</p><p>Non-impact printers spray ink or toner powder and the characters are fixed onto the paper by heating. Examples of non-impact printers are inkjet printers, laser printers and thermal printers.</p><p>Impact printers strike the paper when printing. The most popular impact printer is a dot-matrix printer. Dot-matrix printers print multiple copies using carbon paper.</p></blockquote><p>Dialogue box for (e):</p><div class=\"passage\" style=\"max-width:520px;border:1px solid currentColor;padding:8px\"><p><b>Find and Replace</b> — tabs: Find | <u>Replace</u> | Go To</p><p>Find what: <b>print</b><br>Options: Match Case, Whole Words<br>Replace with: <b>produce</b></p><p>[More &gt;&gt;] &nbsp; [Replace] [Replace All] [Find Next] [Cancel]</p></div><p class=\"row\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"btn ghost\" data-gx=\"opengame\" data-page=\"games/wordsim.html?level=3\" data-id=\"wordsim\">📘 Open the Word Lab</button> <span class=\"hint\">Paste the paragraph and try word count, spell-check and Replace.</span></p>",
