"model": "<p><b>(a)</b> (i) <b>Tables</b>. (ii) <b>Queries</b>. (iii) <b>Reports</b> display fields extracted from <b>Tables</b> (or Queries) in a particular order. (iv) <b>Forms</b>.</p><p><b>(b)(i)</b> ID is the primary key of the CUSTOMERS table — the field on the 'one' side that uniquely identifies each customer. <b>(ii)</b> Customer ID is the foreign key in the ORDERS table — the field on the 'many' side that stores the ID of the customer who placed each order. <b>(iii)</b> Enforce Referential Integrity makes Access check the relationship: an order cannot be entered with a Customer ID that does not exist in CUSTOMERS, and a customer cannot be deleted while related orders exist, so no orphan records are created.</p><p><b>(c)</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table class=\"qbe\"><tr><th>Field</th><td>ID</td><td>First Name</td><td>Last Name</td><td>Phone Number</td><td>Street Address</td><td>City</td></tr><tr><th>Table</th><td>Customers</td><td>Customers</td><td>Customers</td><td>Customers</td><td>Customers</td><td>Customers</td></tr><tr><th>Sort</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><th>Show</th><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>☐</td><td>✔</td></tr><tr><th>Criteria</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>&gt;\"868-500-000\"</td><td></td><td>\"Carenage\"</td></tr><tr><th>or</th><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></table></div><p>(Both criteria are on the same Criteria row, meaning AND.)</p><p><b>(d)</b> IDs <b>7</b> and <b>10</b>. (ID 6 is in Carenage but its number, 868-234-5112, is not greater than 868-500-000.)</p><p><b>(e)(i)</b> The line that loops back from CONDITION to DO TASK is labelled <b>FALSE</b>; the line going down to STOP is labelled <b>TRUE</b> (REPEAT … UNTIL the condition becomes true).</p><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 260 250\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"REPEAT UNTIL flowchart labelled: FALSE loops back to DO TASK, TRUE goes to STOP\" style=\"max-width:260px;width:100%\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"8.0\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"25.333333333333332\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">START</text><polyline points=\"150,36 150,70\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><rect x=\"105.0\" y=\"71.0\" width=\"90\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"89.33333333333333\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">DO TASK</text><polyline points=\"150,101 150,130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><polygon points=\"150,132.0 215.0,160 150,188.0 85.0,160\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"163.33333333333334\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">CONDITION</text><polyline points=\"85,160 40,160 40,55 150,55\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7FB2FF\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">FALSE</text><polyline points=\"150,188 150,214\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F5C542\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">TRUE</text><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"215.0\" width=\"80\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"231.33333333333334\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">STOP</text></svg><figcaption>REPEAT UNTIL loop labelled</figcaption></figure><p><b>(ii)</b></p><figure class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"WHILE loop flowchart: condition tested first; TRUE does task and loops back; FALSE goes to stop\" style=\"max-width:300px;width:100%\"><defs><marker id=\"ah\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"6.0\" width=\"80\" height=\"28\" rx=\"14.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"23.333333333333332\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">START</text><polyline points=\"150,34 150,62\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><polygon points=\"150,64.0 215.0,92 150,120.0 85.0,92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"95.33333333333333\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">CONDITION</text><polyline points=\"150,120 150,150\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F5C542\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"175\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">TRUE</text><rect x=\"105.0\" y=\"151.0\" width=\"90\" height=\"30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"169.33333333333334\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">DO TASK</text><polyline points=\"150,181 150,200 40,200 40,50 150,50\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><polyline points=\"215,92 260,92 260,238 190,238\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#7FB2FF\" marker-end=\"url(#ah)\"/><text x=\"280\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\" font-weight=\"bold\">FALSE</text><rect x=\"110.0\" y=\"225.0\" width=\"80\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"241.33333333333334\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">STOP</text></svg><figcaption>WHILE DO … ENDWHILE loop: the condition is tested before the task</figcaption></figure><p>(START → decision 'CONDITION'; TRUE → DO TASK → arrow back to the condition; FALSE → STOP.)</p><p><b>(f)(i)</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Statement</th><th>WHILE DO…END WHILE Loop</th><th>REPEAT UNTIL Loop</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Is the condition tested at the START or END of the loop?</td><td>START</td><td>END</td></tr><tr><td>Does the loop executes as long as the condition is TRUE or FALSE?</td><td>TRUE</td><td>FALSE</td></tr><tr><td>Statements in the loop must be executed: YES or NO?</td><td>NO</td><td>YES (at least once)</td></tr><tr><td>Number of times to repeat the loop is known: YES or NO?</td><td>NO</td><td>NO</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p><b>(ii)</b> The number of times the loop must repeat must be known (fixed) before the loop starts, so a counter can run from a start value to an end value.</p>",
"key": "<p><b>Mark scheme</b></p><ul><li>(a) 1 per blank (5); (iii) second blank: Tables or Queries.</li><li>(b)(i) Primary key of Customers (1). (ii) Foreign key in Orders (1). (iii) Data in related tables kept consistent/valid (1); example: no order for a non-existent customer / cannot delete customer with orders (1).</li><li>(c) Show ticks correct (1); Street Address unticked (1); \"Carenage\" in City (1); &gt;\"868-500-000\" in Phone Number on the same row (1).</li><li>(d) 7 (1), 10 (1).</li><li>(e)(i) FALSE on loop-back (1); TRUE to STOP (1). (ii) Decision before process (1); TRUE path to task and back (1); FALSE to stop, with start/stop (1).</li><li>(f)(i) 1 per row, both columns correct (4). (ii) Number of iterations known (1).</li></ul>",
