"stimulus": "<p>Study the updated notice about computer viruses reported in a company and answer the questions that follow.</p><div class=\"passage\" style=\"max-width:520px;border:1px solid currentColor;padding:12px\"><p style=\"text-align:center\">[Graphic: a tilted note pinned with a pushpin, reading 'Important Notice']</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><b><u>SUMMARY OF VIRUS ATTACKS FOR <del>3<sup>rd</sup></del> 4<sup>th</sup> QUARTER 2016</u></b></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><b>Total Reports for <del>Jul – Sept</del> Oct – Dec 2016</b></p><div class=\"tablewrap\"><table style=\"margin:auto\"><thead><tr><th style=\"background:rgba(127,178,255,.25)\">Time</th><th style=\"background:rgba(127,178,255,.25)\">Number of<br>Reports</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Morning</td><td><del>23</del> 31</td></tr><tr><td>Afternoon</td><td><del>17</del> 21</td></tr><tr><td>Evening</td><td><del>12</del> 17</td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style=\"text-align:center\"><b><i>Summary of viruses found by time reported</i></b></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">[Pie chart: Morning 45% (horizontal stripes), Afternoon 30% (plain), Evening 25% (dots)]</p><p style=\"font-size:.8em\"><sup>1</sup>Note that morning reports end at 11:00 a.m. and afternoon reports end at 3:00 p.m.</p></div>",
"prompt": "<ol type=\"a\"><li><ol type=\"i\"><li>Identify the word processing feature that was used to update the information in the notice. <i>(1 mark)</i></li><li>State TWO options that can be used to view the updated document. <i>(2 marks)</i></li></ol></li><li>State TWO document formatting features and TWO character formatting features found in the notice.<br>Document formatting features: ……<br>Character formatting features: …… <i>(4 marks)</i></li><li>Name TWO applications, other than a word processor, from which the table or pie chart in the notice could have been imported. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Explain the steps required to place the graphic from another opened application to the location in the notice. <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>State the number of columns and rows in the table.<br>Number of columns: ……<br>Number of rows: …… <i>(2 marks)</i></li><li>Name the feature used and explain its purpose in EACH of the following sections of the text in the notice.<div class=\"tablewrap\"><table><thead><tr><th>Text</th><th>Name of Feature</th><th>Purpose of Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>The heading 'Number of Reports' in the table</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td>The statement at the bottom of the notice</td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div><i>(4 marks)</i></li><li>A function is used to change REPORT to REPORTED throughout the document. Name the function and describe the result of the action.<br>Name of function: ……<br>Result: …… <i>(3 marks)</i></li></ol><p style=\"text-align:right\"><b>Total 20 marks</b></p>",
